WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:04.075
Guide 2. Open your starter on the laptop.

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:11.895
You've practised finding cells in the web
page. Now we're going to open the real
workbook in Excel. Watch me first

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:14.655
and follow the same steps on your laptop. If
I've already given you

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:21.525
your own editable copy in Teams, open that
copy. You don't need to download another
one.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:28.095
Otherwise, select Download Excel starter.
I'll find a file called Year7 Week9

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.635
Eco Budget Starter in my Downloads.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:35.735
In this example, I'm using Excel in a
browser. I'll open my school OneDrive,

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.165
upload the workbook and then open it from
there. Make sure you're using your school
account.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:43.450
Now I can see the workbook. I'm looking for
the Eco-Budget sheet

00:00:43.465 --> 00:00:49.375
and the headings Item, Quantity and Cost per
item. Check that you see those too.

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:55.135
Keep Excel and the lesson web page open.
We'll use both. Now open your workbook.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:01:00.980
Don't change any cells yet. Return to the
lesson web page when you're ready for the
next step.
